es of damage will also have have their Armour and saves reduced by %d.\n\t\tThe chance to apply the effects and the duration increase with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在半径 %d 范围内，将一群敌人身上的热量转移到他们的装备上，把敌人冻僵在地面，多余的热量则令他们无法使用武器和盔甲。\n\t\t造成 %0.1f 寒冷伤害和 %0.1f 火焰伤害，并对敌人施加定身（冻足）和缴械状态，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t受到两种伤害影响的单位也会降低 %d 护甲和豁免。\n\t\t施加状态的几率和持续时间受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d26f35fdfaa751d2d99560c41e1d101d78afd2b219fbda000d35ad8e1580fa0b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c933476e444f567f56fc68fa0725b55fe342992606b688285d0f19b612e6a9ec","logical_entry_identity":"090f7e64077f27645e9546f040403fde7c38fd1ae0a1cd8cd716ae89ead7c582","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Dream Prison","source_tag":"talent name","target":"梦境牢笼"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4265b29ce4a4f4a5d3e38252295a64677fc2e596b7a6f09a640df72529c284cd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c933d91be74705f703249f56140f3f69adfc8ab07d65bc45f119e2abf965f21f","logical_entry_identity":"6c263b7c20883fca04fe77c1f2fad531106b624b9395e2e84a10e38387cb0a1e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Value","source_tag":"_t","target":"数值"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5e85d8f75639aef99a5c58078224711a5485ba601ce5f4fd122a2d55edea9e65","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c93ccc923a17ac1c2b467275e2d3db09ee2218c0efdf0de538cccc7cd46ce384","logical_entry_identity":"397895aef99c9aaef1e0874f4bc8199ee72b2986b51453f444512e125aa95038","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You slash wildly at your target for %d%% (at 0 Hate) to %d%% (at 100+ Hate) damage.\n\t\tAt level 3, any wound you inflict with this carries a part of your curse, reducing the effectiveness of healing by %d%% for %d turns. The effect will stack.\n\t\tThe damage multiplier increases with your Strength.\n\n\t\tThis talent will also attack with your shield, if you have one equipped.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"野蛮的削砍你的目标造成 %d%% （0仇恨）至 %d%% （100+仇恨）伤害。\n\t\t等级 3 时攻击附带诅咒，降低目标治疗效果 %d%% 持